    title: "華盛頓特區衛生部門資料外洩：近 40 萬受益人個人資料遭曝光",
    summary: "華盛頓特區衛生財務部門（DHCF）宣布，近 40 萬名受益人的個人資訊可能遭到資料外洩。受影響的群體包括 2023 年至 2026 年間註冊的 Medicaid 和 DC Healthcare Alliance 受益人。DHCF 表示，此次事件並非駭客攻擊所致，而是發現其網站上的兩份報告包含可供未經授權人士存取的隱藏個人資訊。這些報告本應只顯示群體總計統計數據，但其底層支援的個人資訊可能在 2023 年至 2026 年 7 月期間可被未授權使用者存取。曝光的資料包括 Medicaid ID、提供者名稱、出生日期、種族、性別、族裔和所在區（ward），但沒有包含社會安全號碼、姓名或財務資訊。DHCF 提醒受影響者仍需警惕身份盜竊和詐騙行為，並已立即移除相關報告並進行內部系統檢查。",
    tags: ["DHCF", "Medicaid", "資料外洩", "個人資訊", "華盛頓特區"],
    title_en: "Washington D.C. Health Department Data Leak: Personal Information of Nearly 400,000 Beneficiaries Exposed",
    summary_en: "The Department of Health and Finance of the District of Columbia (DHCF) announced that the personal information of nearly 400,000 beneficiaries may have been exposed through a data leak. Affected groups include Medicaid and DC Healthcare Alliance beneficiaries registered between 2023 and 2026. DHCF stated that the incident was not caused by a hacker attack, but rather was due to the discovery that two reports on its website contained hidden personal information accessible to unauthorized individuals. These reports were only intended to display aggregate group statistics, but the underlying personal information may have been accessible to unauthorized users during the period of July 2023 to 2026. Exposed data includes Medicaid ID, provider name, date of birth, race, gender, ethnicity, and ward, but does not include Social Security numbers, names, or financial information. DHCF advised affected individuals to remain vigilant against identity theft and fraud, and has since immediately removed the relevant reports and conducted internal system checks.",
    tags_en: ["DHCF", "Medicaid", "Data Leak", "Personal Information", "District of Columbia"],
    sources: [
      { name: "SecurityWeek", url: "https://securityweek.com/dc-health-agency-exposes-400000-beneficiary-records", lang: "EN" }
    ]
