    category: "Windows",
    title: "微軟（Microsoft）曝失誤：非營利組織的 M365 數據在保留期結束前被意外刪除，無法恢復",
    summary: "本文報導微軟（Microsoft）發生重大數據處理失誤，導致部分非營利組織（nonprofits）的 Microsoft 365 (M365) 數據在預期保留期結束前被提前刪除。此問題發生在微軟取消其 M365 Business Premium 贈款之後。微軟透過電子郵件承認，由於「錯誤」（error），在應有的保留和匯出窗口關閉前，剩餘的數據已被刪除。微軟的發言人確認，受影響的內容是與客戶過期 M365 Business Premium 訂閱相關的數據。然而，微軟目前無法提供受影響的非營利組織數量，也無法列出哪些數據被刪除，甚至無法確定是否發生了數據丟失。微軟僅表示，他們已調查了恢復選項，但數據無法恢復。公司對此失誤表示遺憾，並為受影響的非營利組織提供免費的「專人服務」（concierge service）協助設置新的 M365 環境，但這無法解決數據丟失的問題。",
    tags: ["Microsoft 365", "M365", "非營利組織", "數據丟失", "Microsoft", "Business Premium"],
    title_en: "Microsoft admits data loss: Nonprofits' M365 data accidentally deleted before retention period ends",
    summary_en: "This article reports a major data handling error by Microsoft, which resulted in the premature deletion of M365 data belonging to some nonprofits before their expected retention period ended. This issue occurred after Microsoft discontinued the M365 Business Premium giveaway. Microsoft acknowledged via email that the remaining data was deleted due to an \"error\" before the proper retention and export window closed. A Microsoft spokesperson confirmed that the affected content relates to data associated with expired M365 Business Premium subscriptions. However, Microsoft currently cannot provide the number of affected nonprofits, nor can it list which data was deleted, nor can it confirm if data loss occurred. Microsoft only stated that they investigated recovery options, but the data cannot be recovered. The company expressed regret over the error and offered affected nonprofits free \"concierge service\" assistance to set up new M365 environments, but this does not solve the data loss problem.",
    tags_en: ["Microsoft 365", "M365", "nonprofits", "data loss", "Microsoft", "Business Premium"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/saas/2026/09/28/microsoft-tells-nonprofits-their-deleted-m365-data-isnt-coming-back/5299433", lang: "EN" }
    ]
