    summary_en: "This article compiles the system update details released by Google during September 2026, covering core components such as Play services, Google Play Store, and Android WebView. Key updates include: Google Play services v26.38, released on September 28, which adds support for the Gemini account login flow and provides developers with new features supporting processes like Maps, Analytics, and Diagnostics. Android WebView v155 was updated on September 23, refactoring the androidx.webkit Navigation and NavigationListener APIs to ensure thread safety, while also enhancing security and privacy protection. Furthermore, the Google Play Store continues to receive functional improvements, such as support for local currency purchases, and stability enhancements in system and account management. These updates are crucial for both end-users and third-party application developers, and users are advised to keep their systems updated to obtain the latest security patches and feature experiences.",
